The bundled editor
==================

`codemirror.bundle.js` in this directory is a build of CodeMirror 6 and the
Lezer parsers it needs, produced by `tools/build-codemirror` from the exact
versions `tools/build-codemirror/package-lock.json` pins. It is committed
rather than built, because Polter compiles nothing for a plugin
(`dev-docs/poltergeist/plugins.md`, `polter-artifacts/2145/PLAN.md` §2.2).

